        "legalContactEmail": "support@puffreeapp.com", "@legalContactEmail": { "description": "Support email shown on legal pages — replace with your real address" }, "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy", "privacyPolicyLastUpdated": "Last updated: January 2026", "privacyPolicyIntro": "Puffree (\"we\", \"our\", \"the app\") helps you track and stay motivated on your journey to quit smoking. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have.", "privacySection1Title": "Information We Collect", "privacySection1Body": "Account details you provide when you sign in (email address, display name, and profile photo), or an anonymous identifier if you use the app without an account. We also store the smoke-free data you enter yourself, such as your quit date, cigarettes per day, cost per pack, and cravings you log.", "privacySection2Title": "How We Use Your Information", "privacySection2Body": "To calculate your streak, health milestones, and money saved; to sync your progress across devices; to send optional motivational reminders and notifications; to process Premium subscription purchases; and to diagnose crashes and improve the app.", "privacySection3Title": "Data Storage & Security", "privacySection3Body": "Your data is stored using Firebase (Google Cloud) with encryption in transit. We apply reasonable technical and organizational safeguards, but no method of storage or transmission over the internet is completely secure.", "privacySection4Title": "Third-Party Services", "privacySection4Body": "We use Firebase Authentication and Cloud Firestore to manage accounts and sync data, and the Apple App Store or Google Play billing systems to process Premium subscriptions. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.", "privacySection5Title": "Your Choices & Rights", "privacySection5Body": "You can review or edit your profile at any time, reset your local progress from Settings, disable push notifications in your device settings, and request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data by contacting us.", "privacySection6Title": "Children's Privacy", "privacySection6Body": "Puffree is not directed at children under 13 (or under 16 in the EU), and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them. If you believe a child has provided us data, please contact us so we can delete it.", "privacySection7Title": "Health Disclaimer", "privacySection7Body": "Puffree is a habit-tracking tool designed to support your smoke-free journey. It is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional about quitting smoking.", "privacySection8Title": "Changes & Contact", "privacySection8Body": "We may update this policy from time to time; significant changes will be announced in the app. If you have questions about this policy or your data, please reach out using the contact details below.", "termsOfUseTitle": "Terms of Use", "termsOfUseLastUpdated": "Last updated: January 2026", "termsOfUseIntro": "These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of Puffree. By creating an account or using the app, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the app.", "termsSection1Title": "Acceptance of Terms", "termsSection1Body": "By downloading, installing, or using Puffree, you confirm that you accept these Terms of Use and our Privacy Policy, and that you have the legal capacity to enter into this agreement.", "termsSection2Title": "Description of Service", "termsSection2Body": "Puffree is a habit-tracking and motivation app that helps you monitor progress after quitting smoking, including streaks, health milestones, money saved, and craving logs. It is a personal wellness tool, not a medical or clinical service.", "termsSection3Title": "Eligibility & Accounts", "termsSection3Body": "You must be at least 13 years old (or the minimum age of digital consent in your country) to use Puffree. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and for all activity that occurs under it.", "termsSection4Title": "Premium Subscriptions & Billing", "termsSection4Body": "Premium features are offered as an auto-renewing subscription billed through the Apple App Store or Google Play. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period, and refunds are handled according to the relevant store's policy.", "termsSection5Title": "Health & Medical Disclaimer", "termsSection5Body": "Puffree does not provide medical advice and is not a substitute for professional care. Quitting smoking can involve withdrawal symptoms; please consult a doctor or licensed healthcare provider before making decisions about your health.", "termsSection6Title": "Acceptable Use", "termsSection6Body": "You agree not to misuse the app, attempt to reverse-engineer or disrupt its services, upload unlawful or harmful content, or use the app in any way that violates applicable laws or the rights of others.", "termsSection7Title": "Disclaimer & Limitation of Liability", "termsSection7Body": "Puffree is provided \"as is\" without warranties of any kind. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the app.", "termsSection8Title": "Changes to These Terms & Contact", "termsSection8Body": "We may update these Terms from time to time; continued use of the app after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms. Questions can be sent to the contact address below.", "systemThemeLabel": "System", "notificationsEnabledLabel": "Notifications enabled",
